'''Kite Cat''' (凧にゃん ''Tako Nyan'', Kite Cat) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears [[Vengeance Awakes!]] and [[Infernal Tower]]. She was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kite Cat
|image = E 260.png
|appearance = [[Vengeance Awakes!|Vengeance Awakens!]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Infernal Tower - Floor 20]]
|money drop = 1,200¢ - 4,740¢}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a fairly fast and powerful attack, with Area Attack. However, it has somewhat low health and a blindspot. If you can get in close, go hog wild.

